OL,3,GNEWSAGP surgery issued warning over
OL,4,Apatient monitoring
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Leicestershire GP surgery has been
OL,7,Fissued with a formal warning after
OL,8,Ffailing to properly monitor patients
OL,9,Fwith chronic conditions such as
OL,10,Fdiabetes and asthma.
OL,12,FCastle Medical Group's centre in
OL,13,FAshby-de-la-Zouch has been downgraded
OL,14,Fby the Care Quality Commission (CQC)
OL,15,Ffollowing an inspection in July, with a
OL,16,Fformal warning issued on 15 September
OL,17,Ffor failing to meet legal regulations.
OL,19,FThe practice, which looks after 18,000
OL,20,Fpatients, was rated "good" after its
OL,21,Flast inspection in 2017, but was told
OL,22,Fit "requires improvement" this year.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
